---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  seo={{
    title: "About PraveenTechWorld — IT Operations & Testing Lab",
    description: "Learn about PraveenTechWorld: our hands-on hardware workbench, sysadmin diagnostics, editorial ethics, and IT operations testing lab led by Praveen.",
    canonical: "https://www.praveentechworld.com/about",
  }}
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:py-16">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="mb-6 text-sm text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400">Home</a></li>
        <li><span class="text-text-muted/60">/</span></li>
        <li class="font-medium text-text dark:text-text-dark" aria-current="page">About Us</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <header class="mb-12 border-b border-border pb-10 dark:border-border-dark">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-100 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-700 dark:bg-brand-900/40 dark:text-brand-300 mb-3">
        Editorial Standards & Testing Lab • Dubai, UAE
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text dark:text-text-dark mb-4">
        Hands-On Sysadmin Diagnostics & Real Engineering Benchmarks
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        PraveenTechWorld is an independent technical engineering publication. We troubleshoot Windows kernel crashes, GPU TDR errors, cumulative update bugs, and local AI infrastructure directly on physical test benches.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-text dark:text-text-dark dark:prose-invert space-y-10">
      
      <!-- Section 1: Who We Are -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text dark:text-text-dark border-b border-border/40 dark:border-border-dark/40 pb-3 mb-4">
          Who We Are & What We Manage
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">
          PraveenTechWorld was founded by <strong>Praveen</strong>, a Web Administrator and IT Operations Lead based in Dubai, United Arab Emirates. With over a decade of hands-on systems experience, our team actively administers and monitors over 30 production servers, multi-tenant DNS infrastructure, Cloudflare WAF enterprise policies, and automated CI/CD deployment pipelines.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">
          We built this site because tech troubleshooting online has become saturated with vague, AI-generated summaries that copy outdated advice from decade-old forums without ever testing whether the steps actually solve the problem. Every runbook, registry key, and PowerShell command we publish is tested against live systems first.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: The Physical Workbench Lab -->
      <section class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface-alt/30 p-6 sm:p-8 dark:border-border-dark dark:bg-surface-dark-alt/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text dark:text-text-dark mb-4">
          Our Hardware Workbench & Testing Methodology
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted mb-6">
          When a Windows cumulative update fails with an obscure hex code, or an NVIDIA driver triggers an Event ID 153 GPU crash, we don't guess. We reproduce the issue in our lab across dedicated physical test workstations:
        </p>

        <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 not-prose mb-6">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-5 dark:border-border-dark dark:bg-surface-dark">
            <span class="text-2xl mb-2 block">🖥️</span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text dark:text-text-dark mb-1">OS Test Rigs</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted leading-relaxed">
              Windows 11 Pro & Enterprise (24H2 / 23H2), clean bare-metal images, and Ubuntu 24.04 LTS under native WSL2 environments with mirrored networking.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-5 dark:border-border-dark dark:bg-surface-dark">
            <span class="text-2xl mb-2 block">⚡</span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-text dark:text-text-dark mb-1">GPU & AI Test Benches</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted leading-relaxed">
              RTX 40-series and 30-series workstations running Ollama, vLLM, LM Studio, and PyTorch CUDA kernels to measure real VRAM headroom and throughput.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text dark:text-text-dark mb-2">Our Diagnostic Protocol:</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">
          <li><strong>Crash Dump Analysis:</strong> We inspect kernel dump files (<code>C:\Windows\Minidump</code> and <code>MEMORY.DMP</code>) using WinDbg to pinpoint the exact driver module causing bugchecks (e.g., <code>0x101 CLOCK_WATCHDOG_TIMEOUT</code>, <code>0x1E KMODE_EXCEPTION_NOT_HANDLED</code>).</li>
          <li><strong>Event Viewer Traces:</strong> We analyze System and Application event logs to isolate TDR recoveries (<code>nvlddmkm Event ID 13</code> and <code>153</code>) and service termination failures.</li>
          <li><strong>Component-Based Servicing Logs:</strong> For failed Windows updates (such as error <code>0x8024200d</code> or rollback loops), we parse <code>C:\Windows\Logs\CBS\CBS.log</code> and <code>setupapi.dev.log</code> to identify corrupted payload packages.</li>
          <li><strong>PowerShell Diagnostic Scripts:</strong> We author, test, and provide automated PowerShell verification scripts so administrators can audit their registry, BCD, or service state safely without risking system corruption.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Editorial Standards & E-E-A-T Ethics -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text dark:text-text-dark border-b border-border/40 dark:border-border-dark/40 pb-3 mb-4">
          Editorial Ethics & Verification Standards
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">
          <p>
            <strong>1. No Scraped or Rehashed AI Content:</strong> We believe strongly in high-signal, first-person developer documentation. We do not publish generic regurgitations. Every diagnostic step is executed by our team.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>2. Falsifiable Technical Claims:</strong> When we recommend an optimization or troubleshooting step, we provide the exact commands and verification tests so you can confirm whether the fix succeeded on your own machine.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>3. Continuous Patch Updates:</strong> Operating systems and drivers are dynamic. When Microsoft or hardware vendors issue updates that supersede a previous workaround, our team revisits, updates, and timestamps the article with fresh test results.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>4. Editorial Independence:</strong> All editorial recommendations are strictly our own. We do not accept paid reviews that mandate positive conclusions, nor do we let advertisers dictate our technical conclusions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Editorial Team & Authors -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text dark:text-text-dark border-b border-border/40 dark:border-border-dark/40 pb-3 mb-4">
          Editorial Team & Testing Engineers
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted mb-6">
          Our articles and runbooks are authored and verified by seasoned IT professionals and organic search specialists:
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 not-prose">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 dark:border-border-dark dark:bg-surface-dark flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                <div class="flex h-14 w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-2xl font-bold text-brand-700 dark:bg-brand-900/40 dark:text-brand-300">
                  P
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text dark:text-text-dark">
                    <a href="/author/praveen" class="hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors">
                      Praveen
                    </a>
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Founder & Lead IT Ops Engineer</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Dubai-based Web Administrator and IT Operations Lead managing multi-tenant enterprise DNS, Linux/Windows infrastructure, and physical test lab diagnostics.
              </p>
            </div>
            <a href="/author/praveen" class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline">
              View All Articles by Praveen →
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 dark:border-border-dark dark:bg-surface-dark flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                <div class="flex h-14 w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-2xl font-bold text-amber-700 dark:bg-amber-900/40 dark:text-amber-300">
                  S
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text dark:text-text-dark">
                    <a href="/author/satyam" class="hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400 transition-colors">
                      Satyam Kumar Dharak
                    </a>
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">Senior SEO Analyst & Contributor</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
                SEO Analyst and Business Owner specializing in organic search strategy, technical SEO auditing, and AI search engine visibility benchmarks.
              </p>
            </div>
            <a href="/author/satyam" class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline">
              View All Articles by Satyam →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5: Contact & Professional Inquiries -->
      <section class="rounded-2xl border border-brand-200 bg-brand-50/50 p-6 sm:p-8 dark:border-brand-900/40 dark:bg-brand-950/20 not-prose">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-text dark:text-text-dark mb-2">
              Have a Technical Question or Lab Feedback?
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
              Found a bug in a Microsoft cumulative update or want us to benchmark a specific local AI model or driver build on our test bench? Reach out to our team directly.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 shrink-0">
            <a
              href="/contact"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-brand-600 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-white transition-all hover:bg-brand-700 shadow-sm"
            >
              Contact Our Team ↗
            </a>
            <a
              href="/guides"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-text transition-all hover:border-brand-600 dark:border-border-dark dark:bg-surface-dark"
            >
              Explore Guides 📚
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-brand-200/60 dark:border-brand-900/30 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">
          <span>📍 Physical Base: Dubai, United Arab Emirates</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>✉️ Contact: <!--email_off-->contact@praveentechworld.com<!--/email_off--></span>
          <span>•</span>
          <a href="/privacy" class="underline hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400">Privacy Policy</a>
          <span>•</span>
          <a href="/terms" class="underline hover:text-brand-600 dark:hover:text-brand-400">Terms of Service</a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

